%% title: Walk-in application, from desk to fee check
%% desc: A guardian comes to the office; the clerk picks the round, fills the boxes the round asks for, adds papers and fee details, and saves. The application gets a reference number and waits in the fee queue until someone checks the fee.
flowchart LR
  G["Guardian comes to the office"] --> C["Clerk: New application<br/>pick the round, fill the boxes"]
  C --> S["Save application<br/>reference number given"]
  S --> Q["Fee check pending"]
  Q -->|"Fee is ok"| L["Can join a list"]:::done
  Q -->|"Send back"| B["Guardian is asked again"]:::stop
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef stop fill:#fff5f5,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#5c1111
